What is a Garment Pattern Cutting Plotter?
Garment Pattern Cutting Plotters are sophisticated CAD/CAM systems that automate the pattern-making process in apparel production. These machines combine high-precision plotting (with accuracy up to ±0.1mm) and digital cutting capabilities (with speeds reaching 1000mm/s), revolutionizing traditional garment manufacturing workflows. The technology enables manufacturers to reduce material waste by 8-12% through advanced nesting algorithms while achieving production speeds impossible through manual methods.

